# M05: Android: screen on and TakeService

## Tasks

The screen stays on while a take records; if it goes off anyway (power button, minimise), a microphone foreground service with a bounded partial wake lock keeps the take recording and the own turn running until it is answered.

**Scope.** `android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml` (service `.TakeService`, `foregroundServiceType="microphone"`, not exported; `uses-permission WAKE_LOCK`), new `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/TakeService.kt` (service + `TakeKeeper` decision object), `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/MainActivity.kt`, `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/HoldService.kt` (`Hold.shouldStart` gains `taking`), `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/Notices.kt` (channel `take`, «Запись», low importance), tests `TakeKeeperTest.kt`, `ManifestExportTest.kt`, `HoldDecisionTest.kt`, `KeepScreenOnTest.kt`.

| Task | Description | Files | SP | Status |
|------|-------------|-------|----|--------|
| 5.1 | `TakeKeeper` (pure): `start(voice, resumed, running)` true when `voice == "listening" && !running` and the activity is resumed or pausing; `stop(voice, resumed, running, takeEndedMs, nowMs)` true when running and (`voice` idle/offline/"" or (`resumed && voice != "listening"`) or `nowMs - takeEndedMs ≥ 180_000` with voice not listening) | `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/TakeService.kt` | 1 | pending |
| 5.2 | `TakeService`: `startForeground(ID=3, «{Имя} записывает…» on channel `take`, FOREGROUND_SERVICE_TYPE_MICROPHONE)`; acquires `PowerManager.PARTIAL_WAKE_LOCK` tag `hermespet:take` with `acquire(9 * 60_000L)`, released in `onDestroy`; a refused start (`RuntimeException`) logs `take: service cannot go foreground` and stops; `companion start(ctx, name)`/`stop(ctx)`/`running` flag; logs `take: service started`/`stopped` | `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/TakeService.kt`, `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/Notices.kt`, `android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml` | 1 | pending |
| 5.3 | `MainActivity`: the existing `vm.state.map { it.voice }` collector also (a) sets/clears `WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_KEEP_SCREEN_ON` (`keepScreenOn(voice) = voice == "listening"`), (b) applies `TakeKeeper` start/stop, recording the take's end time; `onPause` starts `TakeService` if a take runs and it is not running, and skips `HoldService.start` while `TakeService.running`; `onResume` re-applies `TakeKeeper.stop` | `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/MainActivity.kt`, `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/HoldService.kt` | 1 | pending |
| 5.4 | Tests: `TakeKeeperTest` covers start/stop table incl. the 3-min bound; `ManifestExportTest` asserts `.TakeService` is not exported with type `microphone` and `WAKE_LOCK` is declared; `HoldDecisionTest` adds `shouldStart(34, "thinking", taking = true) == false`; `KeepScreenOnTest` (Robolectric, `ActivityScenario` with a fake `PetViewModel` state) asserts the window flag is set while listening and cleared on thinking | `android/app/src/test/java/dev/hermespet/TakeKeeperTest.kt`, `android/app/src/test/java/dev/hermespet/ManifestExportTest.kt`, `android/app/src/test/java/dev/hermespet/HoldDecisionTest.kt`, `android/app/src/test/java/dev/hermespet/KeepScreenOnTest.kt` | 1 | pending |

