# M06: Android: recording wave in the composer, held take kept

## Tasks

While a take records, the composer shows a level wave flowing out of the mic button with the elapsed time, hides the placeholder, field and camera button, and a hold the system cancels becomes a locked take instead of being discarded.

**Scope.** `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/core/{CoreEvent.kt,Decode.kt}` (`CoreEvent.MicLevel`), `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/ui/PetViewModel.kt` (`micLevel` flow), `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/ui/chat/{ChatScreen.kt,Composer.kt,MicButton.kt}`, new `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/ui/chat/RecordingWave.kt`, tests `DecodeTest.kt`, `PetViewModelTest.kt`, `ComposerTest.kt`, `MicButtonTest.kt`, `ChatScreenShotTest.kt`, goldens under `android/app/src/test/screenshots/`.

