| 6.3 | `Composer` gains `micLevel: () -> Float = { 0f }`; while `voice == "listening"`: no `AttachButton`, no `BasicTextField` (text kept in `rememberSaveable`), a × cancel (`voice.cancel`, unlocks) then `RecordingWave` in the field's slot — this replaces the locked «Слушаю» row (the lock icon stays before the wave when locked); `ChatScreen` passes `{ vm.micLevel.value }`; `MicButton` takes `level: () -> Float` and draws the halo at `HALO + level * 10.dp` | `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/ui/chat/Composer.kt`, `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/ui/chat/ChatScreen.kt`, `android/app/src/main/java/dev/hermespet/ui/chat/MicButton.kt` | 1 | pending |
